/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project aims to develop an efficient deep learning-based satellite image dehazing model that leverages Pix2Pix GAN for paired image datasets and CycleGAN for unpaired datasets to enhance image quality while preserving fine details. The model will process hazy multispectral satellite images and generate clear, high-fidelity dehazed images suitable for real-world applications. Additionally, an integrated LLM-based alert system will provide insights based on dehazing results, aiding decision-making in critical applications such as weather forecasting, environmental analysis, and urban planning.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
