/P 394 0 R
/E (The proposed Multispectral Satellite Image Dehazing system leverages advanced deep learning techniques, including U-Net, Pix2Pix GAN for paired images and CycleGAN for unpaired images, to effectively remove haze while preserving structural details. The integration of an LLM-based alert system \(LLaMA\) enhances decision-making by analyzing dehazing results for critical applications such as disaster management and environmental monitoring.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
